{"title":"바이올렛 체로타의 졸속 결혼 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"“바이올렛, 결혼하거라. 이달 내로.”몰락 귀족 영애 바이올렛이 스무 살이 되던 해. 도박에 미친 아버지는 얼굴도 모르는 남자에게 딸을 팔아치웠다.어딘가 모자란 남편감을 예상하며 식장에 선 바이올렛 앞에 나타난 훤칠하고 잘생긴 기사.심지어 그녀보다 어리다?!결혼식을 치르자마자 전쟁터로 떠난 어린 남편은 꼬박 3년 만에 진한 향기를 머금고 남자가 되어 돌아오는데…. “이렇게 돌아왔으니, 이제 너와 진짜 부부가 되고 싶어.”연하 남편 알드릭과 연상 아내 바이올렛의 ‘선 결혼 후 연애’ 졸속 결혼 완성기!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":209,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":30,"change":{"type":"up","amount":179}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":79,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":168,"change":{"type":"down","amount":89}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":97,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":80,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":72,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":73,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":71,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":86,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":244,"change":{"type":"down","amount":158}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":236,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":223,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":223,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":223,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":223,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down"